                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;avoid unobserved task exceptions during connection teardown by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4725112790" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3108" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3108/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3108"&gt;#3108&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;use &lt;code&gt;MemoryPool&amp;lt;byte&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; sources for request/response buffering by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4724389446" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3107" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3107/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3107"&gt;#3107&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;see &lt;code&gt;ConfigurationOptions.RequestBufferPool&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;ConfigurationOptions.ResponseBufferPool&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stabilize CI, especially on Windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4727438404" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3109" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3109/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3109"&gt;#3109&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
